{"step_index":444,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T20:09:11Z","thinking":"**Examining the Filter Input**\n\nThe HTML code includes an input field labeled \"Filter by Available Medicine.\" This input likely facilitates filtering a list of pharmacies based on medicine availability. The `id` attribute, `filterMedicine`, is crucial for associating the input with any filtering logic implemented in the application's JavaScript code.\n\n\n**Refining Input Field Consistency**\n\nThe `onkeyup` event listener within the \"Filter by Available Medicine\" input is redundant; it should be removed as the associated JavaScript handles this functionality. The icon box from \"Search Pharmacy Name\" input should be added to \"Filter by Available Medicine\" for visual and structural consistency. Verifying that the search button remains horizontally aligned after the change is important.\n\nOther uses of `.input-group` on additional pages must be checked to ensure consistency in styling and structure.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Add CSS rules to fix autocomplete inside Bootstrap input-groups","EndLine":460,"Instruction":"Add flex, width, and border-radius rules for .input-group > .autocomplete-wrapper","ReplacementContent":"/* ----------------- Live Autocomplete Dropdown ----------------- */\n.autocomplete-wrapper {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\n/* Fix when autocomplete-wrapper is placed inside Bootstrap .input-group */\n.input-group {\n  flex-wrap: nowrap !important;\n}\n\n.input-group > .autocomplete-wrapper {\n  position: relative;\n  flex: 1 1 auto;\n  width: 1%;\n  min-width: 0;\n  display: flex;\n}\n\n.input-group > .autocomplete-wrapper > .form-control {\n  position: relative;\n  flex: 1 1 auto;\n  width: 100%;\n  min-width: 0;\n  height: 100%;\n}\n\n/* Precision border-radius handling within input-group */\n.input-group > .autocomplete-wrapper:not(:first-child):not(:last-child) > .form-control {\n  border-radius: 0 !important;\n}\n\n.input-group > .autocomplete-wrapper:not(:first-child):last-child > .form-control {\n  border-top-left-radius: 0 !important;\n  border-bottom-left-radius: 0 !important;\n  border-top-right-radius: var(--bs-border-radius, 0.375rem) !important;\n  border-bottom-right-radius: var(--bs-border-radius, 0.375rem) !important;\n}\n\n.input-group > .autocomplete-wrapper:first-child:not(:last-child) > .form-control {\n  border-top-left-radius: var(--bs-border-radius, 0.375rem) !important;\n  border-bottom-left-radius: var(--bs-border-radius, 0.375rem) !important;\n  border-top-right-radius: 0 !important;\n  border-bottom-right-radius: 0 !important;\n}\n\n.input-group > .autocomplete-wrapper > .form-control:focus {\n  z-index: 5;\n}\n\n.autocomplete-dropdown {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 100%;\n  left: 0;\n  right: 0;\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);\n  z-index: 1050;\n  max-height: 380px;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n  margin-top: 4px;\n}","StartLine":440,"TargetContent":"/* ----------------- Live Autocomplete Dropdown ----------------- */\n.autocomplete-wrapper {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\n.autocomplete-dropdown {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 100%;\n  left: 0;\n  right: 0;\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);\n  z-index: 1050;\n  max-height: 380px;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n  margin-top: 4px;\n}","TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\User\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\medcheck-bd\\client\\css\\style.css","toolAction":"Update style.css for autocomplete in input-group","toolSummary":"Fix autocomplete wrapper flex styles in client/css/style.css"}}]}
